{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43546","headline":"与宣供奉携瘿尊归杏溪园联句 · 李益","name":"与宣供奉携瘿尊归杏溪园联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千畦抱瓮园，一酌瘿尊酒。\n唯有沃洲僧，时过杏溪叟。\n追欢君适性，独饮我空口。\n儒释事虽殊，文章意多偶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}